，營業時間很廣，對於加班族來說很友善😂\n\n內用座位約為八至九桌，內用時碗盤餐具都不是免洗的。\n可惜門口有時會有隔壁小店傳來的煙味。\n\n鳳梨炒飯 $75\n有很淡的奶香味，雖然很不搶眼，但我覺得是十分重要且加分的細節。飯粒分明，吃完盤底不會殘留一層明顯的油，還有附贈一碗湯，吃下來頗有飽足感。",null,[0,67]]]],[],[null,null,6559,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjZ3U2blBREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xc8334db120aa64df!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDcgu6nPQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjZ3U2blBREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjZ3U2blBREi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRGNndTZudlFFEhNDZ3dJdTRMUDlnVVFpTmUxNEFJGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRGNndTZuZlESE0Nnd0luWUxQOWdVUS1JR3puQUkiEgkAAAAAAAAAABHfZKogsU0zyCoLMFRvdzN2ZzJMaTc\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjAjsvf9dmWAxUJdfUHHRLhI4wQoykIfSgC"],null,[null,[[1,2]]]],"0ahUKEwiUzs_f9dmWAxXxeV4EHYVKNJIQ0pMFCD0oAw"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjAjsvf9dmWAxUJdfUHHRLhI4wQ0pMFCHkoAw"],[["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqMEttQjdnRRAB",["0x0:0xc8334db120aa64df",null,1714296462996902,1714296462996902,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112970199438364631495/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["YI","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKIrQ614POh-jjY4jFajdADutbYnMZfofMX7qF6m_vwnIXCZg\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112970199438364631495?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"112970199438364631495",null,133,138,null,[1,6,1],8,["在地嚮導 · 133 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjAjsvf9dmWAxUJdfUHHRLhI4wQpr8GCH8oAA"]]]],null,"2 年前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[2],null,[["CIHM0ogKEICAgIDj0KmBXg",["CIHM0ogKEICAgIDj0KmBXg",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmOGv7QCKWgox9EPXoflDH98rc-o3cSWm200dRckXR8tX-I1vRe44pPwWbu14StiDEV9k0hTyZER6Tz535X9Mj3M31E66_S8cJCpqukpnVTuViS9lb-UbxUXASDHcJUUysyc1MBK\u003dk-no",null,[2992,2992]],null,[[3,121.57950201379387,25.038171033697267],[0,90],[2992,2992